      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Climb to the top of the tower as fast as you can. The timer starts the first time you move.


    Aim with the crosshair. It turns orange when the hook can reach a grapple point.


    You can hang for 5 seconds. The rope turns red, then gives out.


    Red spikes cost a heart. Lose all 3 and you start over from the bottom.


    Orange spikes pop up on a timer, and ice is slippery.


    Walls, ledges, and moving platforms cut your rope.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
