  m_text: 'Move: A / D or Left / Right arrows

    Jump: Space

    Fire grappling hook: hold left mouse button

    Let go: release left mouse button

    Swing: A / D while hooked

    Reel in: hold W

    Let out rope: hold S

    Pause: Esc


    Spikes cost a heart. Lose all 3 and you start over.

    Walls and moving platforms cut your rope. You can hang for 5 seconds.'
